stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Unavailable
  Unavailable --> Observing : valid coverage and rebuilt baseline
  Observing --> Alerted : all audible admission guards pass
  Alerted --> Alerted : score decay alone / no correction
  Alerted --> RevisionCheck : all alerted heroes confirmed visible / clear latch
  state RevisionCheck <<choice>>
  RevisionCheck --> Observing : score below revision threshold / spoken correction
  RevisionCheck --> Observing : score at or above threshold / no correction
  Observing --> Unavailable : coverage or session invalid
  Alerted --> Unavailable : coverage or session invalid / silent suspend

  note right of Observing
    Observing does not mean safe.
    Evaluate current data on entry without an extra tick.
    Score alone never grants audible admission.
  end note
  note right of Alerted
    Valid game, identities, coverage and evidence.
    Danger score and nonempty contributor set.
    New absence episodes; global 30 s and per-hero 60 s.
    Verified critical media; native audio authority.
  end note
  note right of Unavailable
    Missing-gank voice stays unavailable
    until DEC-RISK-DETAIL closes.
    No all-clear from gaps, invalidity or decay.
    Other admitted local functions remain independent.
  end note

